# Draught: a giant checkers piece 1.8 m across and 0.36 m thick, centred on the origin and lying flat, its edge well rounded so
# a stack of them reads as separate pieces by the crease between each pair. Plain, with no grooves, so it meshes to few
# triangles: towers stack up to twenty of them. Form only: the model using it paints it red, black or ivory.
format 1

RoundedCylinder radius=0.9 roundness=0.09 height=0.18
